# Settings for flying the tuning runs over MAVLink instead of SITL's UDP receiver
# (tools/tuning/vehicle.py OverrideTransmitter, tools/tuning/board.py). Loaded last on a
# flight controller (--board), and by SITL with --rc mavlink.
# ArduPilot takes RC_CHANNELS_OVERRIDE only from SYSID_MYGCS (GCS_Common.cpp:3990);
# the tools connect as system 250.
SYSID_MYGCS       250
# close the log when the runner force-disarms at the end, before it downloads the log
# (AP_Logger_Backend.cpp:659-667)
LOG_FILE_DSRMROT  1
